Match 2|'''&nbsp;'''\n<!-- 3rd place -->\n|13 June – TBC|Loser {{abbr|UNLF|UEFA Nations League Finals}} Match 1|'''&nbsp;'''|Loser {{abbr|UNLF|UEFA Nations League Finals}} Match 2|'''&nbsp;'''\n}}<section end=\"Bracket\" />\n\n===Quarter-finals===\n<section begin=Quarter-finals />\nThe draw for the quarter-finals will be held after the completion of the league phase. In the draw, teams from the same group cannot be drawn against each other.<ref name=\"regulations\"/><section end=Quarter-finals /><!-- First, the group runners-up will be drawn into a quarter-final pairing (1 to 4), after which group winners will be drawn and allocated to the first available quarter-final (in numerical order).-->\n\n====Seeding====\nThe group winners will be seeded in the draw, while the runners-up will be unseeded.<ref name=\"regulations\"/><!-- The [[#Overall ranking|Nations League interim overall ranking]] of November 2026 is shown below in brackets.-->\n\n{| class=\"wikitable\"\n|+ Quarter-final draw pots\n|-\n! Group\n! style=\"width:150px\" | Winners<br>(seeded in Pot 1)\n! style=\"width:150px\" | Runners-up<br>(unseeded in Pot 2)\n! style=\"width:150px\" | Qualified<br />(position TBD)\n|-\n! [[#Group 1|A1]]\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| \n|-\n! [[#Group 2|A2]]\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| \n|-\n! [[#Group 3|A3]]\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| {{fb|ESP}}\n|-\n! [[#Group 4|A4]]\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| <!--{{fb|}}-->\n| {{fb|POR}}\n|}\n\n====Summary====\n<section begin=Quarter-finals />\nThe first legs will be played on 25–27 March, and the second legs will be played on 28–30 March 2027.\n\n{{#invoke:Sports series|main|flag=n|generate_links=y\n|<!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up|1|<!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner|25–27 Mar|28–30 Mar\n|<!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up|2|<!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner|25–27 Mar|28–30 Mar\n|<!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up|3|<!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner|25–27 Mar|28–30 Mar\n|<!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up|4|<!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner|25–27 Mar|28–30 Mar\n}}<section end=\"Quarter-finals\" />\n\n====Matches====\nTimes are [[Central European Time|CET]]/[[Central European Summer Time|CEST]],{{refn|group=note|name=Time}} as listed by UEFA (local times, if different, are in parentheses).\n\n{{Football box\n|date       = 25–27 {{Start date|2027|3||df=y}}\n|time       =\n|team1      = <!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up\n|score      =\n|report     =\n|team2      = <!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner\n|goals1     =\n|goals2     =\n|stadium    =\n|attendance =\n|referee    =\n}}\n{{Football box\n|date       = 28–30 {{Start date|2027|3||df=y}}\n|time       =\n|team1      = <!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group winner\n|score      =\n|report     =\n|team2      = <!--{{fb|}}-->Group runner-up\n|goals1     =\n|goals2     =\n|stadium    =\n|attendance =\n|referee    =\n}}\n----\n{{Football box\n|date       = 25–27 {{Start date|2027|3||df=y}}\n|time       =\n|team1      = <!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up\n|score      =\n|report     =\n|team2      = <!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner\n|goals1     =\n|goals2     =\n|stadium    =\n|attendance =\n|referee    =\n}}\n{{Football box\n|date       = 28–30 {{Start date|2027|3||df=y}}\n|time       =\n|team1      = <!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group winner\n|score      =\n|report     =\n|team2      = <!--{{fb|}}-->Group runner-up\n|goals1     =\n|goals2     =\n|stadium    =\n|attendance =\n|referee    =\n}}\n----\n{{Football box\n|date       = 25–27 {{Start date|2027|3||df=y}}\n|time       =\n|team1      = <!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group runner-up\n|score      =\n|report     =\n|team2      = <!--{{fb|}}-->Group winner\n|goals1     =\n|goals2     =\n|stadium    =\n|attendance =\n|referee    =\n}}\n{{Football box\n|date       = 28–30 {{Start date|2027|3||df=y}}\n|time       =\n|team1      = <!--{{fb-rt|}}-->Group winner\n|score      =\n|report     =\n|team2      = <!--{{fb|}}-->Group runner-up\n|goals1     =\n|goals2     =\n|stadium    =\n|attendance =\n|referee    =\n}}\n----\n{{Football box\n|date       = 25–27 {{Start date|2027|3|